{"type":"node","id":"task006","parent_id":"us002","node_type":"requirement","title":"TASK-006 lint 命令（符合性校验）","description":"零参数自动发现 + 前置短路 + 规则求值；violations={node_id?,rule,severity,message,hint}；ok=error_count===0","content":"【实现说明】src/commands/lint.js；schema 发现三态与前置短路按 US-002 背景；hint 由 lint 按规则语义内置生成\n【验收标准】见 acceptance 数组\n【验收记录】（完成后回填）","extensions":{"story":"US-002","priority":"P1","acceptance":["GIVEN 绑定模版的包 WHEN dtp lint 零参数 THEN 按 metadata.template.file（相对包目录解析）加载 schema 校验","GIVEN 未绑包 WHEN lint THEN DtpError TEMPLATE_MISSING exit 1（--schema 可临时指定）；GIVEN 绑了但文件丢失/JSON 不可解析 THEN 快速失败且不产生 violations","GIVEN schema version 与记录不同 WHEN lint THEN warn（message 含两版本并提示 re-bind）；GIVEN 同 version 不同 sha256 THEN error SCHEMA_DRIFT","GIVEN 违规包（task 缺 acceptance/acceptance 非数组/挂错父/title 不符模式/approved 无 done_evidence）WHEN lint THEN 逐条报对应 rule，含 message 与内置 hint，error_count>0 且 exit 1","GIVEN 仅编号空洞 warn WHEN lint THEN ok:true 且 exit 0，输出 error_count/warn_count","GIVEN rm 掉中间编号节点（tombstone）WHEN lint THEN 不误报跳号"]},"created_at":"2026-09-11T01:30:02.138Z","updated_at":"2026-09-11T01:30:02.138Z","version":1,"hash":"f0d060694d70c9a74cd28a24c6ae8f88ad9f1caeb631c462426dda6ec1cf5167","tags":["task","template"],"status":"draft"}
