{"type":"node","id":"task004","parent_id":"us002","node_type":"requirement","title":"TASK-004 template 子命令 new/check/bind","description":"单命令文件内 dispatch：new 生成最小骨架/check 自检/bind 写 metadata.template（绑定前先 check，服务升级 re-bind）","content":"【实现说明】src/commands/template.js 单文件 dispatch（new/check/bind），注册进 src/commands/index.js；bind 通过 touchMeta 追加 packet_meta 行（append-only），不手改历史行\n【验收标准】见 acceptance 数组\n【验收记录】（完成后回填）","extensions":{"story":"US-002","priority":"P1","acceptance":["GIVEN dtp template new <name> WHEN 执行 THEN 生成含 comment 注释与最小可跑例子的 schema 骨架，且产物自身通过 template check","GIVEN 坏 schema WHEN dtp template check THEN 逐条列出自检错误且 exit 1，--json 输出单行","GIVEN 有效 schema WHEN dtp template bind <schema> --packet X THEN 包 metadata.template 写入 name/version/sha256/file（相对包文件目录），append-only 落盘；GIVEN 无效 schema WHEN bind THEN 拒绝写入且非 0 退出","GIVEN 未知子命令 WHEN dtp template foo THEN USAGE 错误 exit 2"]},"created_at":"2026-09-11T01:30:02.064Z","updated_at":"2026-09-11T02:20:54.476Z","version":2,"hash":"4f6c3fcf6d176774e807b47d7341d612d8943c0426d9fb53db28cca2def6afdf","tags":["task","template"],"status":"review"}
