{"type":"packet_meta","packet_id":"pkt-8051f4de-8a50-4a12-9e22-f17b8de7a720","name":"用户故事包","version":"v1.0.0","created_at":"2026-09-10T11:19:08.975Z","updated_at":"2026-09-11T02:32:06.979Z","root_node_id":"us_root","metadata":{"scope":"user-stories","purpose":"workflow"}}
{"type":"node","id":"task006","parent_id":"us002","node_type":"requirement","title":"TASK-006 lint 命令（符合性校验）","description":"零参数自动发现 + 前置短路 + 规则求值；violations={node_id?,rule,severity,message,hint}；ok=error_count===0","content":"【实现说明】src/commands/lint.js；schema 发现三态与前置短路按 US-002 背景；hint 由 lint 按规则语义内置生成\n【验收标准】见 acceptance 数组\n【验收记录】（完成后回填）","extensions":{"story":"US-002","priority":"P1","acceptance":["GIVEN 绑定模版的包 WHEN dtp lint 零参数 THEN 按 metadata.template.file（相对包目录解析）加载 schema 校验","GIVEN 未绑包 WHEN lint THEN DtpError TEMPLATE_MISSING exit 1（--schema 可临时指定）；GIVEN 绑了但文件丢失/JSON 不可解析 THEN 快速失败且不产生 violations","GIVEN schema version 与记录不同 WHEN lint THEN warn（message 含两版本并提示 re-bind）；GIVEN 同 version 不同 sha256 THEN error SCHEMA_DRIFT","GIVEN 违规包（task 缺 acceptance/acceptance 非数组/挂错父/title 不符模式/approved 无 done_evidence）WHEN lint THEN 逐条报对应 rule，含 message 与内置 hint，error_count>0 且 exit 1","GIVEN 仅编号空洞 warn WHEN lint THEN ok:true 且 exit 0，输出 error_count/warn_count","GIVEN rm 掉中间编号节点（tombstone）WHEN lint THEN 不误报跳号"]},"created_at":"2026-09-11T01:30:02.138Z","updated_at":"2026-09-11T02:33:49.483Z","version":2,"hash":"8772c77437dc0f366e2d4558cad6bcfadbd7d734e33051df56a64374411fad6f","tags":["task","template"],"status":"review"}
{"type":"changelog","node_id":"task006","field":"status","old_hash":"6ae048f08fcab44bfbc8463f074bfdb40f94c6bdf56d3aad9a7e1c05e5d5b5c1","new_hash":"fe82cb229e29dfc87a309c8d1679ff9f58be239c8e6f3ff52bc431efb3709b6b","timestamp":"2026-09-11T02:33:49.483Z","user":"dev-pane","version":2}
{"type":"packet_meta","packet_id":"pkt-8051f4de-8a50-4a12-9e22-f17b8de7a720","name":"用户故事包","version":"v1.0.0","created_at":"2026-09-10T11:19:08.975Z","updated_at":"2026-09-11T02:33:49.483Z","root_node_id":"us_root","metadata":{"scope":"user-stories","purpose":"workflow"}}
{"type":"node","id":"task006","parent_id":"us002","node_type":"requirement","title":"TASK-006 lint 命令（符合性校验）","description":"零参数自动发现 + 前置短路 + 规则求值；violations={node_id?,rule,severity,message,hint}；ok=error_count===0","content":"【实现说明】src/commands/lint.js；schema 发现三态与前置短路按 US-002 背景；hint 由 lint 按规则语义内置生成\n【验收标准】见 acceptance 数组\n【验收记录】（完成后回填）","extensions":{"story":"US-002","priority":"P1","acceptance":["GIVEN 绑定模版的包 WHEN dtp lint 零参数 THEN 按 metadata.template.file（相对包目录解析）加载 schema 校验","GIVEN 未绑包 WHEN lint THEN DtpError TEMPLATE_MISSING exit 1（--schema 可临时指定）；GIVEN 绑了但文件丢失/JSON 不可解析 THEN 快速失败且不产生 violations","GIVEN schema version 与记录不同 WHEN lint THEN warn（message 含两版本并提示 re-bind）；GIVEN 同 version 不同 sha256 THEN error SCHEMA_DRIFT","GIVEN 违规包（task 缺 acceptance/acceptance 非数组/挂错父/title 不符模式/approved 无 done_evidence）WHEN lint THEN 逐条报对应 rule，含 message 与内置 hint，error_count>0 且 exit 1","GIVEN 仅编号空洞 warn WHEN lint THEN ok:true 且 exit 0，输出 error_count/warn_count","GIVEN rm 掉中间编号节点（tombstone）WHEN lint THEN 不误报跳号"],"done_evidence":"①通过：验收方冒烟——异 cwd 绝对路径零参数 lint 按包目录发现 schema，合规包 ok:true/error0/warn0/exit0；源码确认走 resolveSchemaFile 无裸 path.resolve；②通过：未绑→TEMPLATE_MISSING exit1（单行 JSON 带 bind/--schema 双出路）、--schema 临时指定走通、绑定文件丢失→TEMPLATE_MISSING、JSON 坏→SCHEMA_INVALID，均快速失败不进 violations；③通过：version 不同→schema.drift warn（message 含两版本+re-bind 提示，验收方隔离复现确认）；同 version 不同 sha→SCHEMA_DRIFT exit1；④通过：五类违规（approved 缺 done_evidence/缺 acceptance/acceptance 非数组/挂错父/title 无前缀）→ status.evidence/ext.required/ext.arrays/parent.container/title.pattern 逐条、error_count=5、全带 message+hint、exit1；⑤通过：编号空洞（us001+us003、us002 从未存在）→ 仅 1 条 id.continuity warn 且 ok:true exit0；⑥通过：rm 补号再删 tombstone 入池无跳号 warn。全套 npm test 131/131（基线 123→131，验收方独立复跑含 perf 全绿）。备注：验收中两个初判失败均为验收脚本自身场景设计错误（tombstone 补洞语义、素包 skeleton.missing），非产品缺陷，过程已如实记录"},"created_at":"2026-09-11T01:30:02.138Z","updated_at":"2026-09-11T02:42:31.027Z","version":3,"hash":"fad0c6b93b2e3476dcd37e7148cffa5507837204e312c563ab8bfa3b92be6cdb","tags":["task","template"],"status":"review"}
