{"type":"node","id":"task013","parent_id":"us003","node_type":"requirement","title":"TASK-013 端到端验收与分发收尾","description":"端到端：tgz 全局安装 → init 两态 → .dtp/config → dtp web → 新鲜度与 bump","content":"【实现说明】端到端脚本化留档；收尾按 AGENTS.md 技能新鲜度清单逐项核对\n【验收标准】见 acceptance 数组\n【验收记录】（验收通过后回填一行结论；明细统一记 ext.done_evidence 单一事实源，此处勿复制防漂移）","extensions":{"story":"US-003","priority":"P1","acceptance":["GIVEN 全新空目录 npm i -g <tgz> WHEN dtp init 示例（缺省空壳）THEN .dtp/ 与 config 生成；WHEN dtp init 示例二 --template user-stories THEN 释放故事包且 lint 0/0","dtp web 启动可视化：树/查询/编辑对 .dtp 内包真实可用","新鲜度核对：README（init 示例/.dtp 约定/dtp web/安装章节）、两 SKILL、AGENTS.md；npm test 全绿（预计约 170 用例）；package.json bump minor","publish 动作与 npx 验证不在本轮（另立故事）；npm pack --dry-run 审计通过即收官"]},"created_at":"2026-09-14T04:39:45.210Z","updated_at":"2026-09-14T10:25:48.416Z","version":2,"hash":"9b662cd6a7a469dea7700d69456e2ddd0930c2613710a5fc751f0acb6ce492d1","tags":["task","packaging"],"status":"review"}
