{"type":"node","id":"task014","parent_id":"us004","node_type":"requirement","title":"TASK-014 query --keyword 覆盖标签检索（OPTIM-006）","description":"filterNodes keyword 维度加入 tags；语义变更登记在案（推翻 OPTIM-006 原暂缓判断）","content":"【实现说明】src/query.js filterNodes 的 keyword 维度把节点标签以空格拼接纳入 haystack；README 命令一览 keyword 行与 --help 同步语义\n【验收标准】见 acceptance 数组\n【验收记录】（验收通过后回填一行结论；明细统一记 ext.done_evidence 单一事实源，此处勿复制防漂移）","extensions":{"story":"US-004","priority":"P2","acceptance":["GIVEN 节点带标签 auth WHEN query --keyword auth THEN 命中（大小写不敏感）","GIVEN --tag auth WHEN 查询 THEN 精确行为不变；--json 契约零变更","README keyword 语义描述与 --help 更新为「标题+描述+正文+标签」","既有 query 用例全绿"]},"created_at":"2026-09-16T06:06:24.156Z","updated_at":"2026-09-16T06:06:24.156Z","version":1,"hash":"f84633ed307a346bf6473cd892517ca9d462c1cec4c8f57d95426b621842e65e","tags":["task","query-quality"],"status":"draft"}
