{"type":"node","id":"task016","parent_id":"us004","node_type":"requirement","title":"TASK-016 query/ls 表格扩展摘要（OPTIM-017）","description":"printNodeTable 追加扩展摘要段；--json 契约零变更","content":"【实现说明】src/commands/_shared.js printNodeTable 追加摘要段；截断规则写明；ls 与 query 共享自动同享\n【验收标准】见 acceptance 数组\n【验收记录】（验收通过后回填一行结论；明细统一记 ext.done_evidence 单一事实源，此处勿复制防漂移）","extensions":{"story":"US-004","priority":"P2","acceptance":["GIVEN 节点含扩展字段 WHEN query/ls 人类表格 THEN TITLE 行追加摘要段（数组计数如 acceptance×3、标量键=值、超宽截断规则实现侧定）","GIVEN 节点无扩展字段 THEN 摘要段不出现","--json 输出零变更；既有 query/ls 用例全绿"]},"created_at":"2026-09-16T06:06:06.890Z","updated_at":"2026-09-16T06:20:00.863Z","version":2,"hash":"d7a1abb3648fedda31ac0253c5cab66fc4316001be29ce34ae69d6c444df293e","tags":["task","query-quality"],"status":"review"}
