{"type":"node","id":"task017","parent_id":"us005","node_type":"requirement","title":"TASK-017 template.js 评估层重构（compileRules/WeakMap/evaluateNode）","description":"写路径评估底座：规则编译缓存 + 单节点评估导出；临时单节点包方案（假阳性）已排除","content":"【实现说明】src/template.js 重构；evaluate 与 evaluateNode 共用 compileRules；等价性靠既有 lint/webui 用例守护\n【验收标准】见 acceptance 数组\n【验收记录】（验收通过后回填一行结论；明细统一记 ext.done_evidence 单一事实源，此处勿复制防漂移）","extensions":{"story":"US-005","priority":"P1","acceptance":["evaluateNode(schema,candidate,packet) 新导出：对候选节点跑其适用规则返回 violations","compileRules 抽取+WeakMap 缓存：同 schema 二次编译零成本","evaluate 重构为 compileRules 组合后等价性由既有用例守护（lint/webui 全部用例不动全绿）","纯函数性质保持（无 IO 无状态）"]},"created_at":"2026-09-16T12:24:23.239Z","updated_at":"2026-09-16T12:24:23.239Z","version":1,"hash":"fa78620da5807f02a2adb004a912bc1c1ad92454d26742122f267878d0c7a2fd","tags":["task","write-path","enforce"],"status":"draft"}
