{"type":"node","id":"task018","parent_id":"us005","node_type":"requirement","title":"TASK-018 SCHEMA_VIOLATION 错误契约","description":"SCHEMA_VIOLATION 新错误码 exit 1；violations 随 error 输出（additive）","content":"【实现说明】src/errors.js details 字段 + src/output.js 序列化 + main.js 人类输出\n【验收标准】见 acceptance 数组\n【验收记录】（验收通过后回填一行结论；明细统一记 ext.done_evidence 单一事实源，此处勿复制防漂移）","extensions":{"story":"US-005","priority":"P1","acceptance":["DtpError 支持 details 附加字段（additive，既有错误不受影响）","Output.error 序列化 error.violations 数组（复用 lint 形状 {node_id?,rule,severity,message,hint}）","人类输出逐条违规含 hint（main.js 统一）"]},"created_at":"2026-09-16T12:24:23.293Z","updated_at":"2026-09-16T12:24:23.293Z","version":1,"hash":"e1323c96497c748e0d5c1045872ffa23869a25bc2db7bbf5b94fe45b95ae7f9c","tags":["task","write-path","enforce"],"status":"draft"}
{"type":"changelog","node_id":"task018","field":"*created","old_hash":null,"new_hash":"e1323c96497c748e0d5c1045872ffa23869a25bc2db7bbf5b94fe45b95ae7f9c","timestamp":"2026-09-16T12:24:23.293Z","user":"agent","version":1}
