{"type":"node","id":"task019","parent_id":"us005","node_type":"requirement","title":"TASK-019 enforce 接线与写路径拒绝","description":"混合钩子架构：enforce.js + Packet 钩子 + CLI/webui 两行接线；add/update 写路径拒绝","content":"【实现说明】enforce.js 不与 template.js 循环依赖；mv/checkout 延后二期；rm 产生 ref_exists 悬挂为已知限制写文档\n【验收标准】见 acceptance 数组\n【验收记录】（验收通过后回填一行结论；明细统一记 ext.done_evidence 单一事实源，此处勿复制防漂移）","extensions":{"story":"US-005","priority":"P1","acceptance":["src/enforce.js attachEnforcer(packet)：读 metadata.template+resolveSchemaFile+三态语义（SCHEMA_DRIFT/TEMPLATE_MISSING 与 lint 同源）","Packet 通用 enforcer 钩子默认 null（非 schema-aware 不破坏抽象）；makeContext ctx.load() 末尾+webui mutate 各接一行","enforce 包：9 条 error 规则逐条写路径拒绝 SCHEMA_VIOLATION exit 1+violations 明细+hint，包文件字节零变化","warn 级（id.continuity）随成功写入透传不拦截","非 enforce/未绑定包零回归（行为与现状一致）","webui 编辑 API 对 enforce 包同样被拒（同一 enforcer）","性能冒烟：10k 包单次写延迟增量可忽略（毫秒级）"]},"created_at":"2026-09-16T12:24:23.347Z","updated_at":"2026-09-16T12:24:23.347Z","version":1,"hash":"f97c736ad453a9e184880501523cb529787031798514fdfc4301661963a16408","tags":["task","write-path","enforce"],"status":"draft"}
