{"type":"node","id":"task020","parent_id":"us005","node_type":"requirement","title":"TASK-020 bind --enforce 与 lint 前置门","description":"enforce 开关：bind 参数化 + 前置门（error 违规不配上强制）+ rebind 三态","content":"【实现说明】template.js bind 路径扩展 enforce 字段；前置门复用 evaluate 结果\n【验收标准】见 acceptance 数组\n【验收记录】（验收通过后回填一行结论；明细统一记 ext.done_evidence 单一事实源，此处勿复制防漂移）","extensions":{"story":"US-005","priority":"P1","acceptance":["dtp template bind --enforce 设置 metadata.template.enforce=true；--no-enforce 设 false；都不给保持现值（rebind 防静默关闭）","lint 前置门：包存在 error 级 lint 违规时 --enforce 被拒（提示先修数据/lint 查看）；仅 warn 不挡","开关状态在 bind 输出与 lint 输出可见"]},"created_at":"2026-09-16T12:24:23.400Z","updated_at":"2026-09-16T12:24:23.400Z","version":1,"hash":"82380d21165dd2bcdeb549a2dca5e6866f40696414e3b4ed5d5af2dceb82253b","tags":["task","write-path","enforce"],"status":"draft"}
