{"type":"node","id":"task018","parent_id":"us005","node_type":"requirement","title":"TASK-018 SCHEMA_VIOLATION 错误契约","description":"SCHEMA_VIOLATION 新错误码 exit 1；violations 随 error 输出（additive）","content":"【实现说明】src/errors.js details 字段 + src/output.js 序列化 + main.js 人类输出\n【验收标准】见 acceptance 数组\n【验收记录】（验收通过后回填一行结论；明细统一记 ext.done_evidence 单一事实源，此处勿复制防漂移）","extensions":{"story":"US-005","priority":"P1","acceptance":["DtpError 支持 details 附加字段（additive，既有错误不受影响）","Output.error 序列化 error.violations 数组（复用 lint 形状 {node_id?,rule,severity,message,hint}）","人类输出逐条违规含 hint（main.js 统一）"],"done_evidence":"①通过：验收方独立冒烟（driver 直驱动 Output.error 双模式）——--json 单行契约、error.code=SCHEMA_VIOLATION、error.violations 复用 lint 形状（node_id/rule/severity/message/hint 全字段 deepEqual）、违规明细不在 stderr 重复打印；②通过：无 details 时 error 无 violations 键（既有错误零影响实测）；③通过：人类模式 stderr 逐条 ✗ [rule] node_id message + hint、stdout 无 JSON（不重复）；④通过：SCHEMA_VIOLATION 非 usageCodes → exit 1 映射规则核验。npm test 205/205 独立复跑（基线 201→205）。机制位置偏差（明细打印内聚 Output.error 而非 main.js）按行为等价认可——错误呈现唯一出口收口优于分散"},"created_at":"2026-09-16T12:24:23.293Z","updated_at":"2026-09-16T12:48:01.794Z","version":3,"hash":"3234971c06c316ee01ee5bf75bff5a33274cc7aa7c8956155d4dc8569077c039","tags":["task","write-path","enforce"],"status":"review"}
