{"type":"node","id":"task019","parent_id":"us005","node_type":"requirement","title":"TASK-019 enforce 接线与写路径拒绝","description":"混合钩子架构：enforce.js + Packet 钩子 + CLI/webui 两行接线；add/update 写路径拒绝","content":"【实现说明】enforce.js 不与 template.js 循环依赖；mv/checkout 延后二期；rm 产生 ref_exists 悬挂为已知限制写文档\n【验收标准】见 acceptance 数组\n【验收记录】（验收通过后回填一行结论；明细统一记 ext.done_evidence 单一事实源，此处勿复制防漂移）","extensions":{"story":"US-005","priority":"P1","acceptance":["src/enforce.js attachEnforcer(packet)：读 metadata.template+resolveSchemaFile+三态语义（SCHEMA_DRIFT/TEMPLATE_MISSING 与 lint 同源）","Packet 通用 enforcer 钩子默认 null（非 schema-aware 不破坏抽象）；makeContext ctx.load() 末尾+webui mutate 各接一行","enforce 包：9 条 error 规则逐条写路径拒绝 SCHEMA_VIOLATION exit 1+violations 明细+hint，包文件字节零变化","warn 级（id.continuity）随成功写入透传不拦截","非 enforce/未绑定包零回归（行为与现状一致）","webui 编辑 API 对 enforce 包同样被拒（同一 enforcer）","性能冒烟：10k 包单次写延迟增量可忽略（毫秒级）"]},"created_at":"2026-09-16T12:24:23.347Z","updated_at":"2026-09-16T12:59:40.032Z","version":2,"hash":"6c38d2960c156eb69e2246d8d7345d2b0130ebd31fed791b9bb2e6538ec90468","tags":["task","write-path","enforce"],"status":"review"}
{"type":"changelog","node_id":"task019","field":"status","old_hash":"6ae048f08fcab44bfbc8463f074bfdb40f94c6bdf56d3aad9a7e1c05e5d5b5c1","new_hash":"fe82cb229e29dfc87a309c8d1679ff9f58be239c8e6f3ff52bc431efb3709b6b","timestamp":"2026-09-16T12:59:40.032Z","user":"dev-pane","version":2}
{"type":"packet_meta","packet_id":"pkt-8051f4de-8a50-4a12-9e22-f17b8de7a720","name":"用户故事包","version":"v1.0.0","created_at":"2026-09-10T11:19:08.975Z","updated_at":"2026-09-16T12:59:40.032Z","root_node_id":"us_root","metadata":{"scope":"user-stories","purpose":"workflow","template":{"name":"user-stories","version":"1.0.0","schema_sha256":"621fa9cd1988de3b3aa555c639c68365cd1a6ccaed0ab21ae2be44080eb3374d","file":"templates/user-stories.schema.json"}}}
{"type":"node","id":"task019","parent_id":"us005","node_type":"requirement","title":"TASK-019 enforce 接线与写路径拒绝","description":"混合钩子架构：enforce.js + Packet 钩子 + CLI/webui 两行接线；add/update 写路径拒绝","content":"【实现说明】enforce.js 不与 template.js 循环依赖；mv/checkout 延后二期；rm 产生 ref_exists 悬挂为已知限制写文档\n【验收标准】见 acceptance 数组\n【验收记录】（验收通过后回填一行结论；明细统一记 ext.done_evidence 单一事实源，此处勿复制防漂移）","extensions":{"story":"US-005","priority":"P1","acceptance":["src/enforce.js attachEnforcer(packet)：读 metadata.template+resolveSchemaFile+三态语义（SCHEMA_DRIFT/TEMPLATE_MISSING 与 lint 同源）","Packet 通用 enforcer 钩子默认 null（非 schema-aware 不破坏抽象）；makeContext ctx.load() 末尾+webui mutate 各接一行","enforce 包：9 条 error 规则逐条写路径拒绝 SCHEMA_VIOLATION exit 1+violations 明细+hint，包文件字节零变化","warn 级（id.continuity）随成功写入透传不拦截","非 enforce/未绑定包零回归（行为与现状一致）","webui 编辑 API 对 enforce 包同样被拒（同一 enforcer）","性能冒烟：10k 包单次写延迟增量可忽略（毫秒级）"],"done_evidence":"①通过：源码抽查——Packet.enforcer 默认 null（不感知 schema）、runEnforcer 候选终态提交前调用、main.js/webui 各一行 attachEnforcer、webui handleApi 补 details.violations 序列化（与 CLI 契约一致）；②通过：验收方真实内置模版端到端——bind --enforce 后：已认领挂错容器 add → SCHEMA_VIOLATION exit 1 + violations 含 parent.container + hint、包字节零变化；合规 add 通过；违规 update（坏标题）拦 + 字节零变化；未认领节点放行（v1 非 closed 容器语义，设计行为）；未绑定/未开启包零回归；③通过：warn 级（id.continuity 跳号）随成功写入透传 schema_warnings 顶层键（与篡改巡检 warnings 分键）；④通过：人类模式 stderr 逐条 ✗ [rule] + 可行动 hint（「用 dtp mv 把节点移到符合该规则 scope 的父节点下」）+ dtp: 错误行；⑤通过：webui 编辑 API 同被拒（dev 用例真实子进程 POST 覆盖，套件内）；⑥通过：9 条 error 规则 add 面全覆盖 + update 面 8 条（parent.container 的 update 面属 mv 二期已注释）；性能 10k 单写含 CLI 启动 159ms（评估增量毫秒级）。npm test 220/220 独立复跑（基线 212→220）。备注：验收方首轮夹具为未认领节点（放行属设计行为），换已认领夹具后全过——两处实现缺口（webui 错误出口/violations 透传）dev 自查修复"},"created_at":"2026-09-16T12:24:23.347Z","updated_at":"2026-09-16T13:00:24.604Z","version":3,"hash":"90350f27302180447be82555508f296e5da7f6f09739841d2a7b8e6019efdf20","tags":["task","write-path","enforce"],"status":"review"}
