{"type":"node","id":"task021","parent_id":"us005","node_type":"requirement","title":"TASK-021 文档收尾与 bump","description":"已知限制与产品承诺文档化；技能新鲜度；bump","content":"【实现说明】收尾按 AGENTS.md 新鲜度清单逐项\n【验收标准】见 acceptance 数组\n【验收记录】（验收通过后回填一行结论；明细统一记 ext.done_evidence 单一事实源，此处勿复制防漂移）","extensions":{"story":"US-005","priority":"P2","acceptance":["已知限制写文档：rm ref_exists 悬挂不拦；mv/checkout 延后二期；enforce 态 add 原子全必填为产品承诺","README/SKILL（user-stories+dtp-regression 参数边界清单）更新 enforce 用法","npm test 全绿；双包 verify/lint 全绿；bump minor","publish/npx 仍不在本轮"]},"created_at":"2026-09-16T12:24:23.453Z","updated_at":"2026-09-16T13:03:10.646Z","version":2,"hash":"3e71faba311d9bf797b1813e8e64eb3c8c37e5366cbaa0926a1df02d43ad3851","tags":["task","write-path","enforce"],"status":"review"}
