{"type":"node","id":"task022","parent_id":"us006","node_type":"requirement","title":"TASK-022 settings 命名空间与弃用别名","description":"","content":"【实现说明】src/commands/settings.js 真身：topic/action 两级 dispatch——topic=template 复用自 template.js 升导出的 runNew/runCheck/runBind；新增 settings show 配置态聚合（绑定 schema 名/version/sha、enforce 态、容器清单、逐规则摘要）。src/commands/template.js 改转发壳：stderr 一行弃用提示（人类与 --json 同文案）→ ctx.args 补 topic=template → 复用 settings dispatch；stdout 逐字节等价靠同代码路径保证。dtp template --help 保留原用法加弃用标注。v1 不做 enforce 独立开关、不做 rules 点寻址（留自然扩展）。【验收标准】快照矩阵 action×{人类,--json}×{成功,USAGE} stdout 全等；弃用提示只进 stderr；settings show 四态（无绑/enforce on/off/schema 丢失降级/sha 漂移警告）正确；未知 topic/action USAGE exit 2；test/settings-edges.test.js 全绿。【验收记录】（待回填）","extensions":{"story":"US-006","priority":"P2","acceptance":["settings template new/check/bind 与 dtp template * 在 action×{人类,--json}×{成功,USAGE 失败} 矩阵下 stdout 逐字节等价（快照回归）","旧路径 stderr 恒定一行弃用提示，--json stdout 无任何污染","settings 命令 --help 正常且 summary 点明 scope 为模版与绑定（区分于 .dtp/config.json 语义）；dtp template --help 保留原用法并带弃用标注","settings show 四态正确：无绑定包 / enforce on / enforce off / schema 文件丢失（降级显示不崩）/ sha 漂移（警告不崩），--json 形状稳定","未知 topic/action → USAGE exit 2","test/settings-edges.test.js 覆盖上述矩阵，npm test 全绿"]},"created_at":"2026-09-29T07:06:12.036Z","updated_at":"2026-09-29T07:06:12.036Z","version":1,"hash":"d282642b64513f224ef6c3ca50f60332fe5af3799f433c231cf393010be5397f","tags":["task"],"status":"draft"}
{"type":"changelog","node_id":"task022","field":"*created","old_hash":null,"new_hash":"d282642b64513f224ef6c3ca50f60332fe5af3799f433c231cf393010be5397f","timestamp":"2026-09-29T07:06:12.036Z","user":null,"version":1}
{"type":"packet_meta","packet_id":"pkt-8051f4de-8a50-4a12-9e22-f17b8de7a720","name":"用户故事包","version":"v1.0.0","created_at":"2026-09-10T11:19:08.975Z","updated_at":"2026-09-29T07:06:12.036Z","root_node_id":"us_root","metadata":{"scope":"user-stories","purpose":"workflow","template":{"name":"user-stories","version":"1.0.1","schema_sha256":"2ead9882ce6026acf96d1195ed8697aa03534b2915e5482ab897f7b5ea072571","file":"templates/user-stories.schema.json","enforce":true}}}
{"type":"node","id":"task023","parent_id":"us006","node_type":"requirement","title":"TASK-023 skill 命令与 describeSchema 动态规约","description":"","content":"【实现说明】src/template.js 增第四段导出 describeSchema(schema)：过 checkSchema 门（坏 schema SCHEMA_INVALID），逐规则生成规约文本，展示顺序按拓扑序（compileRules 的 ordered），摘要用原始 pattern 字符串不做正则预编译。src/commands/skill.js 壳：静态层五节（contract/refs/usage/rules/pitfalls）+ 动态层（包绑定 schema 经 describeSchema 生成）；--section 五节白名单；--json 全量 {ok,packet,sections} 与过滤 {ok,packet,section,content} 两形状不混用；裸 dtp skill 零参数走默认包链，无包优雅降级（静态层+init 引导 exit 0、--json packet:null），显式 --packet 缺失 USAGE exit 2。【验收标准】describeSchema 逐字段断言+缓存透明性；skill 五节与 --section 边界；--json 两形状；降级三态（有包/无包/显式缺失）；两真实包快照；test/skill-edges.test.js 全绿。【验收记录】（待回填）","extensions":{"story":"US-006","priority":"P2","acceptance":["describeSchema 导出于 src/template.js 第四段：入参过 checkSchema 门（坏 schema 报 SCHEMA_INVALID），逐规则文本含 scope+match、content_sections 精确字面、ext_required/ext_arrays、status_evidence、ref_exists、tags_require、numbering、rule comment「为什么」","dtp skill 默认 markdown 五节（contract/refs/usage/rules/pitfalls）；--section 白名单枚举，未知节 USAGE 附可用节列表；--section rules 渲染逐规则","--json 单行：全量 {ok,packet,sections} 与 --section 过滤 {ok,packet,section,content} 两形状不混用","裸 dtp skill 零参数：默认链有包→完整规约 exit 0；无包→静态层+init 引导 exit 0 且 --json packet:null；显式 --packet 指向缺失文件→USAGE exit 2","一致性：fixture schema 改 content_sections 等字段→输出同步变（测试断言）；同 schema 对象两次 describe 输出 identical（缓存透明）；user-stories 与 dtp-regression 两真实包快照测试","test/skill-edges.test.js 覆盖上述，npm test 全绿"]},"created_at":"2026-09-29T07:06:12.079Z","updated_at":"2026-09-29T07:06:12.079Z","version":1,"hash":"fe0ba92e2463e18ca7b4b196feee3128b7e89064c23d0fd9749f3ca747953309","tags":["task"],"status":"draft"}
