{"type":"node","id":"task024","parent_id":"us006","node_type":"requirement","title":"TASK-024 文档面同步与回归包 OPTIM 登记","description":"","content":"【实现说明】根 README（命令一览含 settings/skill、子命令计数、使用小节、根 help 注册表顺序核对——registry 插入序即展示序，US-002 漏根 README 前科在案）；.agents/skills/dtp/SKILL.md 与全局副本（速查更新+「进入具体包前先 dtp skill」链路句）；docs/templates/README.md 与 user-stories SKILL 的 template 示例更新为 settings（旧路径标注弃用）；docs/playbook-story-collab.md 如有 template 引用同步；回归包登记两条 OPTIM draft 入池。【验收标准】文档面全同步零遗漏；两 OPTIM 入池且回归包 lint e0 w0；dtp verify 通过；npm test 全绿。【验收记录】（待回填）","extensions":{"story":"US-006","priority":"P2","acceptance":["根 README：命令一览含 settings/skill、子命令计数同步、新增命令使用小节；根 help 注册表顺序与文档一致（registry 插入序核对，防 US-002 式漏根 README）",".agents/skills/dtp/SKILL.md 及 ~/.agents 全局副本：命令速查更新 + 「进入具体包前先 dtp skill」链路句","docs/templates/README.md 与 .agents/skills/user-stories/SKILL.md：template 示例更新为 settings，旧路径标注弃用","回归包登记两条 OPTIM（template 收归+弃用别名计划；webui 未来复用 describeSchema）draft 入池，lint e0 w0","docs/playbook-story-collab.md template 引用同步（如有）；dtp verify 通过；npm test 全绿"]},"created_at":"2026-09-29T07:06:12.123Z","updated_at":"2026-09-29T07:06:12.123Z","version":1,"hash":"0ab65fa5e78b184dd49dea33f09f9055ebf035f360f3587c3d8166b40feb80a0","tags":["task"],"status":"draft"}
